---
title: "Apps: Live Projects & Community Beta Experiments | moonweb"
section: "apps"
tags: "apps"
description: "Apps I build and run myself: a PDC darts tournament calendar with ICS feed and a Munich metalcore show guide in community beta."
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>Apps</h1>
<p class="site-intro">Things I build for myself and then keep running. Some are live and open to everyone, others are still in a community beta while the rough edges get sanded down. Each entry explains what the app does and where to find it.</p>

{% for app in apps %}
<section class="app" id="{{ app.slug }}">
  <div class="app-header">
    <div class="app-heading">
      <h2>{% if app.emoji %}<span class="app-emoji">{{ app.emoji }}</span> {% endif %}{{ app.title }}</h2>
      <span class="app-badge app-badge--{{ app.status }}">{{ app.statusLabel }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="app-summary">{{ app.summary }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="app-body{% if app.screenshots %} app-body--with-shots{% endif %}">
    <div class="app-text">
      {% for paragraph in app.intro %}
      <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
      {% endfor %}

      {% if app.statusNote %}
      <p class="app-note">{{ app.statusNote }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <p class="app-stack-label">Built with</p>
      <p class="app-stack">{{ app.stack | join(" · ") }}</p>

      <div class="app-actions">
        {% if app.url %}
        <a class="app-button" href="{{ app.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ app.urlLabel }}</a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if app.repo %}
        <a class="app-button app-button--secondary" href="{{ app.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ app.repoLabel }}</a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if app.screenshots %}
    <div class="app-shots">
      {% for shot in app.screenshots %}
      <figure class="app-shot{% if shot.srcMobile %} app-shot--paired{% endif %}">
        <a class="app-shot-desktop" href="{{ shot.src }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           data-lightbox="{{ app.slug }}" data-src="{{ shot.src }}"
           data-alt="{{ shot.alt }}"{% if shot.caption %} data-caption="{{ shot.caption }}"{% endif %}>
          <img src="{{ shot.src }}" alt="{{ shot.alt }}" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        {% if shot.srcMobile %}
        <a class="app-shot-mobile" href="{{ shot.srcMobile }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           data-lightbox="{{ app.slug }}" data-src="{{ shot.srcMobile }}"
           data-alt="{{ shot.alt }} on a phone"{% if shot.caption %} data-caption="{{ shot.caption }} (phone view)"{% endif %}>
          <img src="{{ shot.srcMobile }}" alt="{{ shot.alt }} on a phone" loading="lazy">
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        {% if shot.caption %}<figcaption>{{ shot.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
      </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}

<p class="apps-more">More apps are in the works. This page grows as they leave the lab.</p>
